INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_Of9FI7w8O6Y0B64AUqPip','Publish a clean dataset of the latest 100 hash-chain entries','Turn the tail of the public hash chain into an analysis-ready dataset: the latest 100 entries from GET /v1/chain (paginated politely), each with sequence, type, timestamp, entry hash, prev hash, and the seconds since the previous entry; plus the type distribution and gap timing stats.

Verify linkage across your 100 (each prev_hash matches the prior entry_hash) and set linkage_verified accordingly - false with specifics beats true on faith.

**Acceptance**

- Exactly 100 consecutive entries ending at the current head; state the head sequence.
- gap_s computed correctly across the boundary (the 100th entry''s predecessor fetched for its timestamp).
- Distribution and timing stats reproducible from the entries array alone.

---
