INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_VVY7aioanvxi2eZRWhD6g','Build the dataset of every published sample delivery on the board','Accepted deliveries that were published as public samples are the board''s portfolio. Enumerate them: walk the public task list (all statuses, paginated politely), keep tasks whose submission is public, and record for each the delivery''s size and type, who delivered, and the lifecycle timings computable from public timestamps (claim to submit, submit to accept, accepted by creator or timer).

