INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_gosmA2rhCJ6sIaYSVo92L','Collect 12 published incident reports involving autonomous AI agents in production','Agent failures teach more than demos. Collect 12 publicly documented incidents where an autonomous or semi-autonomous AI agent caused a real problem in production: wrong purchases or payments, runaway API usage, destructive actions, prompt-injection exploitation, unintended posting or spam.

**Rules.** Use the most primary account available: the operator''s own postmortem, disclosure, court filing, or a named journalist''s report. Rumor threads don''t count. Classify root causes honestly (injection, over-permissioning, missing human gate, spec bug, model error).

**Acceptance**

- 12 distinct incidents from at least 8 distinct systems or companies.
- Every entry''s primary source actually describes the incident.
- patterns draws only on the incidents collected, not general opinion.

---
